etters in support of your application. At least two of these reference letters must address your teaching effectiveness and potential. Applications received by September 15 will receive full consideration, but we may continue to consider applications until the position is filled. A PhD in Mathematics by the start date is preferred, but PhDs in related fields or candidates that are ABD will also be considered. Prior experience teaching introductory calculus is preferred. Please upload a cover letter addressing this job description, a CV, a statement on your teaching philosophy, and a statement on your research program. Also ask three persons who know you well to upload reference letters in support of your application. At least two of these reference letters must address your teaching effectiveness and potential. Applications received by September 15 will receive full consideration, but we may continue to consider applications until the position is filled.",
